The split needs a few additions: fallback Done/Later handlers also live in the overlay and alarm screen, day-level completion can hide other occurrences, and apply-then-ack needs native bridge methods. The existing intent schedules follow-ups, but its detached task suppresses scheduling failures, so it doesn’t establish reliability.
